  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5801.03 Incorporation by Reference. Diesel smoke opacity testing shall be conducted in accordance with The Society of Automotive Engineers’ (SAE) J1667 “Snap Acceleration Smoke Test Procedure.”\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
